{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10127010","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10127010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1012701001:0":{"text":"이미르, 꼼짝말고 항복해!","source_cn":"伊米尔，束手就擒吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B450ECFFFE85AFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012701002:0":{"text":"닥쳐! 이 땅거미 숲을 지배할 나에게 감히 네 따위가 내게 명령을 하다니!","source_cn":"住口！我才是有资格号令薄暮丛林的人！而你算什么东西……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79AE45345E7730D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012701003:0":{"text":"내 시대를 잘못 타고 나는 바람에... 네게 기회를 빼앗기고 말았지! 하지만 땅거미 숲의 힘만 가지게 된다면... <style=\"highlight\">난 영생을 누릴 수 있다고</style>!","source_cn":"我生不逢时……才让你钻了空子！然而只要拥有薄暮丛林的力...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADEAAD52F4CDBF9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1012701004:0":{"text":"숲의 생명력은 당신께 아니야. 모든 생명은 결국 시들기 마련이니 운명을 받아들여!","source_cn":"丛林的生命力不属于你，所有的叶子终将枯萎，面对你的命运吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDA8BFC701551352","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1012701005:0":{"text":"입 다물어! 흙에서 썩는 건 다프니와 아든의 운명이지! 내가 아니야!","source_cn":"闭上你的嘴！烂在土里是达赫妮跟雅顿的命运！不是我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x028DA4F28DFA5DA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1012701006:0":{"text":"넌 정말 완전히 타락했구나! 이미르!","source_cn":"你简直是一颗彻头彻尾的臭豆子！伊米尔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC1E17C7546DF4BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1012701007:0":{"text":"다프니 할머니?!","source_cn":"达赫妮婆婆？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F334BFB9DFFE3E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1012701008:0":{"text":"오호호... 우리 두 늙은이가 제때 온 것 같구먼.","source_cn":"噢呵呵……看来我们这两把老骨头赶上了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x435461BA36A8448F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1012701009:0":{"text":"아든 선생님!","source_cn":"雅顿老师！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23EDCCC26A8BDB6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1012701010:0":{"text":"아든, 늙은이는 너지, 난 아니라고!","source_cn":"雅顿，只有你是老骨头！我可不是！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42AA45F3DBDC5787","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1012701011:0":{"text":"이미르! 자신의 욕망